{"text": "One day. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They met Baviaan. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The wise old baboon. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was the wisest animal. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In all of South Africa. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Where did all the animals go. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Asked the Leopard. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Baviaan winked and said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They went into other spots. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> My advice to you, Leopard. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Is to go into other spots. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As soon as you can. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then the hunter asked. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And what about me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You should change, too, as soon as you can said Baviaan. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They did not understand. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But they went to look for the forest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After many days. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They saw a great, tall forest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Inside the tree trunks were covered. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With spots and stripes of shadow. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is dark here. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But full of little pieces of light. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said the Leopard.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", "e", " ", "d", "a", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", "y", " ", "m", "e", "t", " ", "B", "a", "v", "i", "a", "a", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "w", "i", "s", "e", " ", "o", "l", "d", " ", "b", "a", "b", "o", "o", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "i", "s", "e", "s", "t", " ", "a", "n", "i", "m", "a", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".",